iClusterPlus was first submitted to Bioconductor in March 2013
iClusterPlus was re-submitted to Bioconductor in November 2013
iClusterBayes was added to Bioconductor in April 2018
Fix compiling errors caused by R 4.3.x, related to argument FCLEN in BLAS and Lapack routines. February 2023
Updated functions including iCluster2b, tune.iCluster2b, iClusterPlus2 and iClusterBayes2 were added into the package in March, 2026.
Tutorials for the updated functions were also included in the iClusterPlus package in March, 2026.

